 class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170909234722&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elemental_Crystal_1d5e84.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an elemental crystal.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 3.20 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Looks the same as an <a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle%20%28Item%29\">icicle</a>, but it does not melt. It also makes somehow good decoration item.\n<br/>\n</p><p>10 of these are needed to do <a href=\"#/quest/shadows-of-yalahar-quest\">Shadows of Yalahar Quest</a>. They can be obtained by <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">picking</a> a slain <a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Elemental\">earth elemental</a> during the 3rd mission. After giving crystals to <a href=\"#/wiki/Telas\">Telas</a> it is no longer possible to gather them.\n<br/> Buying them directly from Black Bert is somehow useless as crystals are relatively easy to get, much easier than leather with <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">obsidian knife</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Bert\">Black Bert</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">After completing <a href=\"#/quest/the-thieves-guild-quest\">The Thieves Guild Quest</a>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Bert\">Black Bert</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Elemental\">Earth Elemental</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle%20%28Item%29\">Icicle (Item)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/shadows-of-yalahar-quest\">Shadows of Yalahar Quest</a></li><li>Yalahari Worker Golems (Book)</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["shadows-of-yalahar-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"shadows-of-yalahar-quest","quest":"Shadows of Yalahar Quest","step":"0-0","n":1,"title":"Decidir o que fazer tu e o que comprar","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32339,"y":32206,"z":6,"label":"Black Bert"}]},{"slug":"shadows-of-yalahar-quest","quest":"Shadows of Yalahar Quest","step":"3-1","n":25,"title":"Recolher 10 Elemental Crystals","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"buy":[{"npc":"Black Bert","where":"Thais","pri